		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>糖、发酵蜘蛛眼、羊毛和一个铁砧。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>围巾配方中的砧锤暗示了它对移动的影响。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "6C36888A3C559178"
			tasks: [{
				id: "44FC195A89CC5B32"
				item: "terramity:stillness_scarf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 9.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>迷失的灵魂，怨恨的灵魂，羊毛和糖。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>迷失的灵魂最容易对付。陵墓里到处都是它们，暮光岩怪在生命值低于</grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>150时</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会掉落，试炼尖塔里的所有生物也一样。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "19B3B820DAE832B7"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6535D829AB8D0398"
				item: "terramity:rebound_scarf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -8.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>焦虑护身符周围的暗物质和铀-235，</grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>焦虑护身符</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Exodium 源自 profanum、一个反棱镜和一个裂纹微观世界，所以它位于金属阶梯的最末端。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "3839ED83141FB841"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0B2B473CBCEC5CCA"
				item: "terramity:exodium_shield_amulet"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -7.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Exodium 周围的 Daemonium 块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>守卫吊坠系列的爆炸型。在房间内引爆黑洞炸弹前，先佩戴它吧。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "548A5AA17595D35C"
			tasks: [{
				id: "031B0D464A96A59E"
				item: "terramity:blastguard_pendant"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -6.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Daemonium 块、Daemonium 和 Hellspec 合金。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>Exodium Shield Amulet</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的基础，所以即使你从不佩戴，最终也会制作一个。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "0D5C921644005FEF"
			tasks: [{
				id: "16A7477B1285354F"
				item: "terramity:anxiety_amulet"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -5.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>红宝石、地狱合金、一个 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>虚空守卫吊坠</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和一个 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>熔岩坠饰</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>三个守卫吊坠为这一个提供能量，使其成为该家族的最高端物品。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1232B4A801849128"
			tasks: [{
				id: "502D9FA76B93214C"
				item: "terramity:solar_safeguard_pendant"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -4.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>怨恨的灵魂、红宝石和火药围绕着一条 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>蜂蜜项链</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>怨恨的灵魂来自村民，或者来自地狱岩，当你的生命值低于 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>250 时，它们就会出现，当然你也可以选择不要它们。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
			]
