		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>下界合金和一颗红宝石。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>火焰守卫。在靠近 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>profanum</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 之前穿上它，否则仅仅是把它放在背包里就会让你着火。</grad></shadow>"
