		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>死亡时会恢复半颗心。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warning] 整合包中没有此物品的配方。必须自行寻找。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是Terramity最便宜的死亡保险，而且佩戴不花一分钱。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "24D8F7C808EA0388"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2131BF90578998D7"
				item: "terramity:focus_scarf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 6.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>潜水装备</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、海之心、</grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>脚蹼</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、羊毛和沙子。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能吃掉另外两个配件，其中一个能在水中赋予海豚之优雅。这就是将水上配置折叠成一个槽位的结果。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "6525318D9F89912F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4A74231EAFDA98A9"
				item: "terramity:seafarer_scarf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 7.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一块虹彩碎片，一颗棱镜宝石，羊毛和紫水晶。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是</grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>Concealment Scarf</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的基础，所以它既是垫脚石，也是占位符。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "7A3425B405BEDE7F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "55A27CFCCFD3B514"
				item: "terramity:prismatic_scarf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 8.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>腐化基岩粉尘和一枚 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>幻影护身符</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>缝制在黄色羊毛中。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它吞噬的护身符会在10格内的所有实体上标记发光，因此这是升级版，能让你知道身后有什么。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "291E47C2ADAC30BA"
			tasks: [{
				id: "70E34B11FD1CE6BE"
				item: "terramity:all_seeing_scarf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -8.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>反棱镜、虚空合金和黄金包裹着一条 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>棱镜围巾</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>反棱镜意味着暗影巫师已死，这使得这成为你能制作的最后几条围巾之一。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "660CB20E9278A907"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7067EDCBF6F194F4"
				item: "terramity:concealment_scarf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 9.5d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>仅在</grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>Trial Spire</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的宝箱中生成，别无他处。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它的名字和[null]的乐谱相同，后者会移除你击中的所有事物的无敌帧。自己得出结论吧。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "4FFB2BABC23EEF9B"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2603030E722B5890"
				item: "terramity:null_scarf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 8.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>盖亚岩簇和维伦特矿。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>繁茂洞穴和下界合金废料，使其成为普通金属项链之后最早的项链之一。它会变成 </grad><grad from=#3B8FE2 to=#B0D8FF f=0.8>尼克斯的项链</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "2E67345ED7623B2A"
